# Atomic-Chat ↔ ODS ↔ LEONES

**Profile:** local application unifying multiple inference engines behind an OpenAI-compatible API.

**LEONES status:** P2.

## Summary

Atomic-Chat combines upstream llama.cpp, a TurboQuant variant and MLX-VLM, and adds speculative decoding.

## ODS fit

It is useful as an architectural example of how several inference engines can be exposed through a common application layer without forcing clients to know which backend is running.

ODS could borrow this separation while keeping runtime selection in its own capability registry.

**Classification:** multi-engine architectural reference.